{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02391","headline":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 十四 · 韦渠牟","name":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠佩紫霞缨，夫人会八灵。\n太霄犹有观，绝宅岂无形。\n暮雨徘徊降，仙歌宛转听。\n谁逢玉妃辇，应检九真经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦渠牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}